<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African Dec gold/forex reserves 10.30 bln rand.</title>
<headline>S.African Dec gold/forex reserves 10.30 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's combined gold and foreign exchange reserves fell 629.48 million rand in December to 10.305 billion rand from November's 10.93 billion rand, when they rose 650.84 million rand, Reserve Bank figures show.</p>
<p>Economists polled by Reuters had forecast December reserves at 10.85 billion rand, with the range 10.4 to 11.2 billion rand.</p>
